WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.155
Today your child meets the silent e.

2
00:00:02.605 --> 00:00:09.417
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.917 --> 00:00:11.931
Start with a word your child can read.

4
00:00:15.034 --> 00:00:16.049
The word is cap.

5
00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:22.054
Now add the e at the end. It makes no sound. But it changes the sound in the middle.

6
00:00:22.554 --> 00:00:24.797
Listen to the middle sound without the e.

7
00:00:26.282 --> 00:00:27.845
And now with the e at the end.

8
00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:31.541
That long sound is the name of the letter.

9
00:00:34.848 --> 00:00:35.858
The word is cape.

10
00:00:36.758 --> 00:00:41.338
On the page, the silent e is gray, and the long sound has a line under it.

11
00:00:41.788 --> 00:00:45.622
The words to say to your child are in the yellow box. Read them out.

12
00:00:46.072 --> 00:00:51.262
Do the four pairs of job one together. The short word first, then the word with the e.

13
00:00:51.712 --> 00:00:57.796
If your child reads the short word again, do not say the word. Say: look at the end. Is there an e?

14
00:00:58.246 --> 00:01:04.172
There is also a card to cut out, on the next page. Your child lays it at the end of a short word.

15
00:01:04.622 --> 00:01:10.195
For job two, press play for your child and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

16
00:01:10.645 --> 00:01:14.107
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Mark each one.
